%S A399302 2,5,120,3644,220881,17134886,1648722283,191452393284,26420925972002
%N A399302 Number of equivalence classes of n X n matrices over {0,1,2} with exactly two 1s and two 2s in each row and column.
%C A399302 Equivalence is defined by independent row and column permutation. Also, nonisomorphic Eulerian orientations of 4-regular bicolored graphs with n vertices of each color.
%e A399302 For n=4, the two solutions are
%e A399302   1 1 2 2     1 1 2 2
%e A399302   1 1 2 2     2 1 1 2
%e A399302   2 2 1 1     2 2 1 1
%e A399302   2 2 1 1     1 2 2 1
%K A399302 nonn,hard,more,new
%O A399302 4,1
